{"strongs": "H5237", "word": "נָכְרִי", "translit": "nokh.ri", "root": "נכר", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "foreign, alien", "definition": "נָכְרִי adjective foreign, alien (Late Hebrew נָכְרִי = Gentile ); — ׳ נ absolute masculine Zeph 1:8 +; feminine נָכְרִיָּה Exod 2:22 +; masculine plural נָכְרִים Isa 2:6 + 2 t. + Prov 20:16 Kt (> Qr נָכְרִיָּה ), + Prov 27:13 (so read for ᵑ0 נָכְרִיָּה ); feminine plural נָכְרִיּוֺת Gen 31:15 +; — 1. a. foreign: עַם נָכְרִי Exod 21:8 ( E ) a foreign (non-Israel) people, ׳ אִישׁ נ Deut 17:15 (|| לֹא אָתִיךָ ); ׳ מַלְבּוּשׁ נ Zeph 1:8 אֶרֶץ נָכְרִיָּה Exod 2:22 ( J ) foreign land , so Exod 18:3 ( E ); especially נָשִׁים נָכְרִיּוֺת foreign (non-Israel) women 1Kgs 11:18 ; Ezra 10:2 ; Ezra 10:10 ; Ezra 10:11 ; Ezra 10:14 ; Ezra 10:17 ; Ezra 10:18 ; Ezra 10:44 ; Neh 13:26 ; Neh 13:27 . \\ \\ b. as substantive נָכְרִי foreigner (non-Israel) Judg 19:12 (+ אֲשֶׁר לֹא מִבְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל ), 1Kgs 8:41 (+ אֲשֶׁר לֹא מֵעַמְּךָ ), = 2Chr 6:32 (+ id. ), 1Kgs 8:43 = 2Chr 6:33 ; Deut 14:21 (|| גֵּר ), Deut 15:3 ; Deut 23:21 (opposed to אָחִיךָ ), Deut 29:21 (+ אֲשֶׁר יָבאֹ מֵאֶרֶץ רְחוֺקָה ); as predicate, 2Sam 15:19 (|| גֹּלֶה ), נָכְרִיָּה Ruth 2:10 plural נָכְרִים foreigners Lam 5:2 ( זָרִים ), Obad 1:11 (|| id. ); compare יַלְדֵי נָכְרִים Isa 2:6 feminine plural alien women Gen 31:15 ( E ; i.e. not of one's father's family). 2. נָכְרִיָּה foreign woman , as technical term, in Proverbs, for harlot (perhaps because harlots were originally chiefly foreigners): Prov 2:16 (|| אִשָּׁה זָרָה ), Prov 7:5 (|| id. ), Prov 5:20 (|| זָרָה ), Prov 6:24 (|| אֵשֶׁת רָ֑ע ), Prov 23:27 (|| זוֺנָה ). — On Prov 20:16 ; Prov 27:13 see below 3. figurative unknown, unfamiliar: נָכְרִי הָיִיתִי בְּעֵינֵיהֶם Job 19:15 an alien am I become in their eyes ; לִבְנֵי אִמִּי ׳ נ Ps 69:9 (|| מוּזָר הָיִיתִי לְאֶחָ֑י ); ׳ אִישׁ נ Eccl 6:2 of ׳ י 's judgment, נָכְרִיָּה עֲבֹדָתוֺ Isa 28:21 strange is his task! (|| זָר מַעֲשֵׂהוּ ); גֶּפֶן נָכְרִיָּה Jer 2:21 an alien vine (opposed to זֶרַע אֱמֶת ), figurative of degenerate Israel; as substantive, נָכְרִים Prov 20:16 Kt (> Qr נָכְרִיָּה ), alens , persons unknown to him (|| זָר ), so read also (for ᵑ0 נָכְרִיָּה ) || Prov 27:13 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5211')\">BDB5211</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5237')\">H5237</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5210')\">BDB5210</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5212')\">BDB5212</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נָכְרִי</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>foreign, alien</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <bdbheb>נָכְרִי</bdbheb> = <highlight>Gentile</highlight>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> absolute masculine <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:8\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,8)\">Zeph 1:8</ref> +; feminine <bdbheb>נָכְרִיָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 2:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,2,22)\">Exod 2:22</ref> +; masculine plural <bdbheb>נָכְרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 2:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,6)\">Isa 2:6</ref> + 2 t. + <ref ref=\"Prov 20:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,16)\">Prov 20:16</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> (&gt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>נָכְרִיָּה</bdbheb>), + <ref ref=\"Prov 27:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,27,13)\">Prov 27:13</ref> (so read for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>נָכְרִיָּה</bdbheb>); feminine plural <bdbheb>נָכְרִיּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 31:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,15)\">Gen 31:15</ref> +; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlight>foreign:</highlight> <bdbheb>עַם נָכְרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 21:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,8)\">Exod 21:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>a foreign</highlight> (non-Israel) people, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אִישׁ נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 17:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,17,15)\">Deut 17:15</ref> (|| <bdbheb>לֹא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אָתִיךָ</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַלְבּוּשׁ נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:8\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,8)\">Zeph 1:8</ref> <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ נָכְרִיָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 2:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,2,22)\">Exod 2:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>foreign land</highlight>, so <ref ref=\"Exod 18:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,3)\">Exod 18:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); especially <bdbheb>נָשִׁים נָכְרִיּוֺת</bdbheb> <highlight>foreign</highlight> (non-Israel) <highlight>women</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,18)\">1Kgs 11:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:2\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,2)\">Ezra 10:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,10)\">Ezra 10:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:11\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,11)\">Ezra 10:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:14\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,14)\">Ezra 10:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:17\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,17)\">Ezra 10:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:18\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,18)\">Ezra 10:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:44\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,44)\">Ezra 10:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 13:26\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,26)\">Neh 13:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 13:27\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,27)\">Neh 13:27</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> as substantive <bdbheb>נָכְרִי</bdbheb> <highlight>foreigner</highlight> (non-Israel) <ref ref=\"Judg 19:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,12)\">Judg 19:12</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר לֹא מִבְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:41\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,41)\">1Kgs 8:41</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר לֹא מֵעַמְּךָ</bdbheb>), = <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:32\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,32)\">2Chr 6:32</ref> (+ <highlight>id.</highlight>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:43\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,43)\">1Kgs 8:43</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:33\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,33)\">2Chr 6:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 14:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,14,21)\">Deut 14:21</ref> (|| <bdbheb>גֵּר</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Deut 15:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,3)\">Deut 15:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 23:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,21)\">Deut 23:21</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>אָחִיךָ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Deut 29:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,21)\">Deut 29:21</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר יָבאֹ מֵאֶרֶץ רְחוֺקָה</bdbheb>); as predicate, <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:19\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,19)\">2Sam 15:19</ref> (|| <bdbheb>גֹּלֶה</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>נָכְרִיָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ruth 2:10\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(8,2,10)\">Ruth 2:10</ref> plural <bdbheb>נָכְרִים</bdbheb> <highlight>foreigners</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lam 5:2\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(25,5,2)\">Lam 5:2</ref> (<bdbheb>זָרִים</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Obad 1:11\" b=\"31\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(31,1,11)\">Obad 1:11</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>); compare <bdbheb>יַלְדֵי נָכְרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 2:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,6)\">Isa 2:6</ref> feminine plural <highlight>alien women</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 31:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,15)\">Gen 31:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; i.e. not of one's father's family). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>נָכְרִיָּה</bdbheb> <highlight>foreign woman</highlight>, as technical term, in Proverbs, for <highlight>harlot</highlight> (perhaps because harlots were originally chiefly foreigners): <ref ref=\"Prov 2:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,16)\">Prov 2:16</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אִשָּׁה זָרָה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Prov 7:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,5)\">Prov 7:5</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Prov 5:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,5,20)\">Prov 5:20</ref> (|| <bdbheb>זָרָה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Prov 6:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,24)\">Prov 6:24</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אֵשֶׁת רָ֑ע</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Prov 23:27\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"2